Esc Beenden was a span in the review block

The session chrome renders it as a Link. The review block replaces that
chrome and rendered the same words as a span - identical on screen,
silently dead to a mouse, on the screen you spend the most time on. Both
copies in ReviewBlock are links now.

Reported from real use: "sometimes esc button with mouse click is not
working properly". Sometimes, because it works everywhere except here.

